===================================================
    
1-1. FLOAT + FLOAT => FLOAT     

===================================================
cast(2 as float)+ cast(1.1 as float)    typeof( cast(2 as float)+ cast(1.1 as float))    
3.1     float     

===================================================
    
1-2. FLOAT + DOUBLE => DOUBLE     

===================================================
cast(2 as float)+ cast(1.1 as double)    typeof( cast(2 as float)+ cast(1.1 as double))    
3.1     double     

===================================================
    
2-1. DOUBLE + DOUBLE => DOUBLE     

===================================================
cast(2 as double)+ cast(1.1 as double)    typeof( cast(2 as double)+ cast(1.1 as double))    
3.1     double     

===================================================
    
3-1. FLOAT keeps fewer significant digits than DOUBLE     

===================================================
cast(1.12345678901234567 as float)    cast(1.12345678901234567 as double)    
1.1234568     1.1234567890123457     

===================================================
    
3-2. FLOAT and DOUBLE with -, *, / (floating-point division)     

===================================================
cast(1 as float)/ cast(3 as float)    typeof( cast(1 as float)/ cast(3 as float))    
0.33333334     float     

===================================================
cast(1 as double)/ cast(3 as double)    typeof( cast(1 as double)/ cast(3 as double))    
0.3333333333333333     double     

===================================================
cast(2 as double)- cast(1.1 as double)    typeof( cast(2 as double)- cast(1.1 as double))    
0.8999999999999999     double     

